2026-10-23: executed-instruction attribution again, on the current K16 Image.
Diagnostic only. No kernel, Image, contract, timeout or verdict changes.
K02, K03, K10 and K11f stay OPEN.

The October 13 profile (kernel-tcg-instruction-profile.out) measured the EvoCC
Image of compiler 820bfa29. On October 19 the same tree was rebuilt with
compiler f6c6f5e1 (kernel-direct-virt-receipt.json). This run repeats the
October 13 lane, plugin, payloads, marks and limits on the rebuilt Image.
The final October 13 BPF runs used the mark __arm64_sys_arm64_personality,
and so does this run. The payloads were copied before use; every result.json
reports its inputs unchanged.

