Both 256 MiB tests fault in the same 256 MiB of guest memory, so their
counts agree closely. The unchanged no-argument demand_paging_test and
memslot_modification_stress_test end at the 120-s limit with EvoCC (124),
while GCC now finishes both (0). Their work differs, so no ratio is given.

pidfd instruction classes, EvoCC / GCC: move 2.63, frame 2.98, load 2.47,
store 3.06, branch 2.57.

